\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13788878\charrsid13788878 There is a fundamental distinction between these two situations.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8199746 ZEUK}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13788878\charrsid13788878 r current test does:
